# ghost-toggle (M8): the Original toggle as a button (GhostToggle.tsx). A transform set (2 typed into
# a's box), the toggle (1189.13, 826, 160.88 x 36 in the reference's DOM: its centre (1269.5, 844))
# is on, its 2 px --primary line; a click turns it off: the dashed original goes, the toggle's line
# --border and its content at 45 %, --secondary under the pointer; away from it, --card; a click puts
# the ghost back. The clicks' shots catch the original's fade a frame in (FV 05: 160 ms, linearly;
# M10 made the port's); the others are at rest.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 300
click 383 424
wait 16
type "2"
key Enter
click 760 48
wait 1500
click 1269 844
wait 16
shot off
wait 484
move 760 48
wait 500
shot off-rest
click 1269 844
wait 16
shot on
move 760 48
wait 500
shot on-rest
